# Osteomancer Adept (CR 701.61a, 118.8): forage is exiling three cards from your graveyard or sacrificing a Food. Turn 1 Bot1 casts a Gilded Goose (a
# Food token) and the Adept, and Faithless Looting discards Grizzly Bears and a Plains: the graveyard holds Black Lotus, Faithless Looting, the Bears and
# the Plains, so either forage could be paid, and Bot1 is asked which. On turn 3 the Adept taps; the Bears are cast from the graveyard for {1}{G} and
# Bot1 pays the forage by sacrificing the Food: the graveyard keeps its other three cards, nothing is exiled, and the Bears enter with a finality counter.

